                logging messages for debugging purposes.

   GGiiaanntt
     If _G_i_a_n_t must be acquired, it must be acquired prior to acquiring other
     mutexes.  Put another way: it is impossible to acquire _G_i_a_n_t non-recur‐
     sively while holding another mutex.  It is possible to acquire other mu‐
     texes while holding _G_i_a_n_t, and it is possible to acquire _G_i_a_n_t recur‐
